    <!-- EVERY DAY (launchd Weekday: 0/7=Sun, 1=Mon, 2=Tue…), machine LOCAL time —
         the mini is Central.

         MONDAY ADDED 2026-08-17 (Eve): "que salga temprano como todos los días y
         luego haga un refresh por la tarde". Monday used to be excluded here and
         handled by board_catchup.sh at 14:30, so the link landed seven hours
         after every other day's — one day a week the approvers had to remember a
         different habit, and the one day the board is the whole closed week.
         THE TRADE, ACCEPTED: Monday's 07:00 picture shows last week with SUNDAY
         MISSING for the two day-behind sections — Retail JE (publishes ~13:53)
         and SARA/Retail NL+Internet (~14:00); Frontier reads the emailed Credico
         PDF. board_catchup.sh at 14:30 still re-fills those into the board, but
         SILENTLY now — it posts nothing and does not touch the link or the PDF,
         it just gets the numbers right before Tuesday's rollover freezes the
         week (week.py:_ref lags Monday, so Monday's fill still writes the closed
         week). So: the emailed picture can undercount Sunday, the BOARD is
         correct by ~14:45. If Raf ever needs Monday's picture complete, the fix
         is to move the LINK back to the afternoon, not to re-add a second post.

         07:09 is the real slot. Eve's ask (2026-08-13): "que corra el llenado y
         se envie el link de revision todos los dias a las 7am para aprobar y que
         se envie a las 7:15 mas tardar" — the link goes UP, the approvers have
         it in front of them, and the ✅ watcher
         (com.alphalete.org-board-email-review, every 5 min) turns their
         checkmark into a sent email inside five minutes.

         07:00 -> 07:09 (Eve 2026-08-25), TO GET BOX INTO THE EMAILED PICTURE.
         The whole morning shifted nine minutes so the ONE section the 04:50
         fill is too early for can be topped off first: Box's extract lands
         ~06:50-08:00, com.alphalete.org-board-box-repull re-pulls Box alone at
         06:52 / 06:58, and the public post follows at 07:05. This has to stay
         behind BOTH — the PDF is built off the board, and the review post is
         what the approvers actually look at. Deadline unchanged and still met:
         link 07:09, checkmark ~07:15-07:20, email OUT BY 07:25. Move this and
         move 06:52 / 06:58 / 07:05 with it.
         07:30 / 08:00 / 09:00 are a safety net for a morning where the board
         wasn't filled yet at 07:00 — a day-marker file in output/day_state makes
         them no-ops once a link is up, so nobody gets the link posted twice.
         09:00 is the LAST slot and the only one that raises a failure alert. -->
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
